  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...No? You gotta try 'em. They are out of this world! Ohh! I'm just so happy you're back, Khan. I've hated having to do your job for you.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Alyvia_EMP_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254366,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I apologize, Alyvia. I never intended for you to shoulder the burden of the Radiant Throne for this long. For that, I thank you.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_King_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_88.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1397572,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "However, you were supposed to help the Alphoi stand tall against any encroaching threat, not revel in denial while it consumes Zanadu!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_King_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_89.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1397572,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Umm... I'm a Muse. I inspire people to greatness, not lead them to it. Big diff! Without their king, the Alphoi had nothing to fight for.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Eagle_MuseF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Alyvia_EMP_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254366,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I think I've done a great job of keeping their spirits up and safe from the Shadow. This party is more the Alphoi's doing than mine. Sorta.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Eagle_MuseF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Alyvia_EMP_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254366,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I understand, Alyvia. Thank you. But I am back now - with help. And we will take Zanadu back! We just need to circumvent that Shadow Wall...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_King_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_90.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1397572,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ugh, THAT thing. Yeah, as far as I know, you can't. General Ellectryk's Light Brigade has tried and no luck. Maybe he can tell you more.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Eagle_MuseF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Alyvia_EMP_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254366,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You need to get to the Aethyrium, right? Talk to General Ellectryk and watch his imagination at work.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Alyvia_EMP_09.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
